      "Categories": {
        "value": "Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR 2|Photographs taken on 2022-06-16|Flickr files uploaded by Red panda bot|Photos in Flickr Explore|Files from the James Webb Space Telescope Flickr stream|James Webb Space Telescope images of nebulae",
